pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업식 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2015.08.14.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">세부내역은 추후 공지 예정입니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업가능여부 확인메뉴 안에 </span><span style=\"COLOR: #941515; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업가능여부 확인자료 재산출 버튼</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">을 눌러 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">현재 기준으로 졸업사정결과 및 내역이 재산출 됩니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">제공 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2015.07.30.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">목</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 8.5.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) [</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업 확정 시까지</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">제공 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2014</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 후기</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(2015</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업대상자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">※ </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년 이상 재학생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">건축학전공 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) : 3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 중 제공</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">추후 공지 예정</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPAC